OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 2 DEC
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GElizabeth Alker marks the 90th
OL,11,     Gbirthday of the BBC Scottish
OL,12,     GSymphony Orchestra, she also has
OL,13,     Gexclusive recordings of great
OL,14,     GRomantic violin concertos and
OL,15,     Gchamber music from Sweden.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: John Rutter
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod speaks to John
OL,18,     GRutter about his extraordinary
OL,19,     Gmusical career in his 80th
OL,20,     Gbirthday year. Today, John talks
OL,21,     Gabout his love of Cambridge,
OL,22,     Gwhere he got his big break.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
